{"sections":[{"slug":"Pontryagin类","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Pontryagin类"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Pontryagin 类”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">实向量丛的复化给出了包含映射</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{B}O(n)\\to \\mathrm{B}U(n),\r\n$$\nPontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">类</span> $p_k\\in H^{4k}(\\mathrm{B}O(n))$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":" $c_{2k}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的拉回乘以</span> $(-1)^k$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}